    "lines": [
      "[Teleport] Hey, as you know, I am already",
      "dead. Long before our fighter ancenstors were",
      "wiped out from here after the war with demon. ",
      "But those grieving souls, cursed by Igolas,",
      "never found peace. At last, those spirits became",
      "gate guard for the lower floor of Endless Tower. ",
      "The fighter of the continent, please solace our",
      "spirits.",
      "You can't enter this Endless Tower, covered with ",
      "Igolas's curse on foot, but I will help you.",
      "Please take care.",
